<title>UK: TABLE-Harvey Nichols yr pretax 12.1 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Harvey Nichols yr pretax 12.1 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.9		   vs 10.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.9		    vs nil</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.8		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     12.1		   vs 9.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   114.2		  vs 90.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pretax profit at about 13 million stg.</p>
<p>Operating profits rose 29 percent to 12.3 million stg for the year.</p>
<p>Full company name - Harvey Nichols Group Plc . --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
